<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 586 MLN OF POLISH BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 586 MLN OF POLISH BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 477 million zlotys of Poland's 16-percent two-year bonds and for 109 million of 12-percent five-year bonds, against the treasury's joint 800 million zloty offer, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
